  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Absolute Lithops Effect**: rare: 9 archived performances [5]\n- **For Charles Bronson**: rare: 11 archived performances [5]\n- **Ripple**: rare: 7 archived performances [5]\n- **Rotten Stinking Mouthpiece**: rare: 8 archived performances [5]\n- **Surrounded**: back after 48 archived shows (1552 days); rare: 14 archived performances [5]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **tMG2013-07-06** (recommended): source not stated; 16 songs; 52 min; rated 5/5 by 3 [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Festival audience was largely unfamiliar with John Darnielle's work, which shaped the stage banter between songs [4]\n- After a song that had been lost, a festival MC took the microphone and gave an awkward compliment about the crowd singing along [4]\n- The MC then qualified the compliment, conceding that only the chorus was familiar to the crowd [4]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **tMG2013-07-06**: taped by Dan Schram [1]",
